{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "A Day With Vanessa", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "An Improvised Lunch", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Second Conditional - Talking About Hypothetical Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the second conditional to talk about unreal or imaginary (hypothetical) situations in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If I had a million dollars, I would buy a car.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do you have a million dollars?  No.<br/>Is it possible to suddenly get a million dollars? Not really.<br/>What would you do if you had a million dollars? Buy a car.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the simple past verb + <span class=\"italic\">would</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">simple past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">simple past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">would + base verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I married Peter,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would be happy.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"it snowed next July,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would be very surprised.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I were you,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would be jumping up and down.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Remember to use a comma (,) after the if clause. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In conversation, it is common to use contractions. (I would = I'd)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you went every day, you would get bored with it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I had my camera, I'd be taking pictures right now! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I had my shawl, we could sit on it.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Wishes and Imaginary Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> and the second conditional to talk about things you want or would like to be different now or in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Wishes and sentences in the second conditional infer that what you want is probably not possible, or for some reason impossible.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish it were all that easy!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's not that easy.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If having it all were so easy, everyone would be happy.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Everyone is not happy.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If college was actually like they showed it in the movies, it would be a snap!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"College is not like they show it in the movies. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I could just go back for a few days and enjoy it all again.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I can't go back.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I were young again!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am not young anymore.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I wish I could go every day!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I wish I had my camera!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I wish I wore my shawl.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "crisp", "type": "name"}, {"content": "cool; fresh; invigorating (when talking about the weather)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's so clear and crisp outside. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about social activities.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to jot down", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to write down quickly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I could jot a few ideas down.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "grassy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "covered with grass", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are plenty of grassy areas and the ground seems dry.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "photo op", "type": "name"}, {"content": "short for photo opportunity", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What a great photo op! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shawl", "type": "name"}, {"cont