       You're right! I wish I had my laptop on me so I could jot a few ideas down.", "id": 3, "time": "46000", "image": "engenn7le16ob05re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le16ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}